    <div class="proj-copy">
      <div class="proj-number">01 · UX/UI Design · Eplan</div>
      <h2>eManage</h2>
      <p class="proj-subtitle">A cloud app that makes complex engineering collaboration feel simple.</p>

      <div class="proj-block">
        <div class="proj-block-label">The Problem</div>
        <p>Engineering teams at Eplan were juggling project files across disconnected systems — no single place to exchange, manage, or extend their work. The ask was straightforward: fix that. The execution was not.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="proj-block">
        <div class="proj-block-label">What I did</div>
        <p>I led a full 5-day design sprint with the development team to align on scope before a single pixel was placed. From there I owned the entire design process: research, information architecture, prototyping, and UI. Beyond shipping a functional cloud project management system, I co-wrote the go-to-market strategy, executive summaries, and pitch decks for the platform's future roadmap.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="proj-block">
        <div class="proj-block-label">The result</div>
        <p>A production-ready cloud web app — including a product name and icon — launched on schedule for Q3 2020. A rare case where design led strategy, not just aesthetics.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="nda-notice">
