    <div class="proj-copy">
      <div class="proj-number">03 · Art Direction · Salt Works</div>
      <h2>McDonald's Germany — Vegan Burger Campaign</h2>
      <p class="proj-subtitle">Making plant-based feel like a no-brainer — for an audience that wasn't asking for it.</p>

      <div class="proj-block">
        <div class="proj-block-label">The Challenge</div>
        <p>Launching a vegan burger to McDonald's Germany's core audience — who largely weren't vegan and weren't particularly curious about becoming so — required creative that was confident, not preachy. The campaign had to live across Facebook, Instagram, the McDonald's website, and the mobile app, each with its own format and audience expectations.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="proj-block">
        <div class="proj-block-label">What I did</div>
        <p>As part of the art direction team at Salt Works, I concepted and produced the digital ad suite for the campaign. Formats ranged from social statics and animations to in-app creatives. The creative challenge: make something feel fresh and modern without alienating the core McD customer. For the record — we tested the product ourselves. It was genuinely good.</p>
      </div>

