    <div class="proj-copy">
      <div class="proj-number">04 · Content Creation · Salt Works</div>
      <h2>McDonald's Germany — 365 Social Campaign</h2>
      <p class="proj-subtitle">A year of content. One consistent creative voice across every scroll.</p>

      <div class="proj-block">
        <div class="proj-block-label">The Scale</div>
        <p>A 365-day social media campaign for McDonald's Germany is exactly what it sounds like: content for every single day of the year, across Facebook and Instagram. That's not a project — that's a machine. And it only works if the creative team understands both the brand voice and the platform mechanics inside out.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="proj-block">
        <div class="proj-block-label">What I did</div>
        <p>I was part of the editorial and content creation team responsible for scripting, producing, and editing video content within this always-on campaign. Working at this scale taught me how to maintain quality under pressure, how editorial thinking shapes visual storytelling, and how social content needs to be designed for the thumb-stop moment first.</p>
